  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation, under the leadership of the MSPAS, of the transition towards the sustainability of strategies, resources and intersectoral actions to eliminate malaria in Guatemala. - Guatemala (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guatemala, Malaria, Ministry of Health and Social Assistance of the Republic of Guatemala (MSPAS)This program has the following goals: Consolidar bajo la rector&#xed;a y el liderazgo del MSPAS a trav&#xe9;s de la transici&#xf3;n hacia la sostenibilidad, las estrategias y los recursos para eliminar la malaria de Guatemala, garantizando el acceso a los servicios de salud de la poblaci&#xf3;n en riesgo, la participaci&#xf3;n social, las acciones intersectoriales y un sistema de vigilancia robusto y eficiente./ Under the stewardship and leadership of the MSPAS and through the transition towards sustainability,consolidate strategies and resources to eliminate malaria from Guatemala, guaranteeing access to health services for the population at risk, social participation, intersectoral actions and a robust and efficient surveillance system.. The objectives of this program are: Asegurar el acceso y derecho a la salud, a trav&#xe9;s de la prevenci&#xf3;n, la detecci&#xf3;n, el diagn&#xf3;stico temprano y el tratamiento oportuno de la malaria de acuerdo con la normativa nacional, con enfoque de calidad en la atenci&#xf3;n. / Ensure access and right to health, through prevention, detection, early diagnosis and timely treatment of malaria in accordance with national regulations, with a focus on quality care..  Garantizar la rector&#xed;a y gobernanza a nivel estatal con la participaci&#xf3;n comunitaria y la intersectorialidad para lograr un trabajo coordinado y articulado que permita mitigar los determinantes sociales y ambientales de la malaria. / Guarantee stewardship and governance at national level with community participation and intersectorality to achieve coordinated and articulated work that allows mitigating the social and environmental determinants of malaria..  Fortalecer el sistema de vigilancia epidemiol&#xf3;gica, parasitol&#xf3;gica  y entomol&#xf3;gica, de manera integral, que permita un an&#xe1;lisis e interpretaci&#xf3;n sistem&#xe1;tica de la malaria, para la toma de decisiones oportuna. /  Strengthen the epidemiological, parasitological and entomological surveillance system, in a comprehensive manner, that allows a systematic analysis and interpretation of malaria, for timely decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
